    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/extras/f8dc357a0734d83f3ceb36f800dff914.avif?t=1749486305\" width=512 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Restaurant</strong> is a management and simulation game where you manage an automation-based restaurant in the depths of space. <strong>Play solo or with your friends</strong> and open a restaurant under a business license granted by SYN CORP, serving customers, optimizing production processes, and growing your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/extras/b7da92be1f5cc0a02b3eb7262ab37460.webp?t=1749486305\" width=343 height=63 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/extras/e1dfe6f458db219ef2f102ed6e32d56a.avif?t=1749486305\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/extras/3dc119f63dffb1145ad0bba68acf11f6.poster.avif?t=1749486305\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/extras/3dc119f63dffb1145ad0bba68acf11f6.webm?t=1749486305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/extras/3dc119f63dffb1145ad0bba68acf11f6.mp4?t=1749486305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/extras/abd789ab4be72b9b9